+explicit android:process=com.android.phone; DUMP caller permission + userdebug guard.
+UID1001, actual processName, PhoneApp application and initialized PhoneFactory prove
+same phone VM. No shared-UID second APK. Opening screen performs no Binder operation.
+UI clearly explains shared SIM2/eSIM hardware path and service interruption.
+Explicit prepare confirmation installs one Honor callback pair once per VM. Explicit
+second confirmation requests one eSIM visibility switch, no profile operations.
+Separate explicit Return physicalSIM2 button only after eUICC endpoint observed and
+fresh opposite eUICC baseline. A new adapter/serial/querytoken per direction; each
+once. UNKNOWN refuses automated or implicit opposite mutation/retry.
+
+Thread/lifecycle
+Metadata, registration, baseline/status query and mux submission run on dedicated
+HandlerThread LdyAn00EsimTrial, not phone UI/mainLooper. Binder callbacks post immutable
+scalar/copy snapshots onto same worker. Main UI only posts operations/displays bounded
+nonidentifying events. Synchronous Binder itself has no guaranteed wall-clock return;
+worker watchdog cannot interrupt it. Absolute entry deadline is checked after metadata,
+before modelbegin and immediately before dispatch. Terminal stopped flag rejects late
+baseline after failure/deadline. No Binder reacquire/clear/re-registration after uncertain
+outcome. Lifetime owner remains even Activity disappears; death increments generation.
+One registration is source-audited, not a remote get-owner/CAS claim. Original Honor
+client class presence refuses; finalimage must audit all unexpected clients/call sites.
+
+Protocol
+Reviewed16 reconstructed AIDL files included, exactnamespace vendor.honor.hardware.hnradio.
+Soong hostaidl genrule produces Java intermediates (not checked-in generated source),
+version6 with HASH UNQUALIFIED-HOST-ONLY. Observed remote vendorV6/hash is a separate
+metadata gate; never forged into callback source identity. Source semantics integer enum
+associations not proven remain wireint32, no original-IDL-source identity claim.
+All40 response and12 indication methods explicitly overridden. Relevant1005 solicited
+response and1002 unsolicited route to adapter; other Honor callbacks logged by method
+name only, not rawpayload. Standard AOSP SIM callbacks remain separate as nativeproof.
+No arbitrary vendor command API exposed by Activity/owner. Native callback registration
+path fromBinder validates interface descriptor/constructs proxies; audited Honor setter
+only stores shared_ptr pair, no callback metadata hash/version query. Saved native
+callback-frombinder-metadata-assembly.json and prior setter assembly bound this finding;
+no claim all later nativecode can never query metadata. A successful compile is not
+runtime callback ABI/Enforcing compatibility qualification.
+
+Fresh status and return path
+Physical slot2/index1 only. Baseline must have validATR/present card, opposite target.
+Fresh ordinary RIL card status carries owner token in Message.obj->AsyncResult.userObj.
+Generation, queryid, slotmapping, ATR and normal UiccController state must agree.
+URC1002 is advisory; stale URC cannot invent target classification. Max3 eventdriven
+queries and finite10s operation watchdog. New model allows targetselector0 and1 using
+fresh opposite baseline; no action to opposite selector on unknown.
+TARGET_OBSERVED is an endpoint receipt, NOT solicited success/provisioning or safe
+recovery guarantee; later transport errors/death retained separately in logs.
+No logs of IMSI/ICCID/EID/profile activation codes/ATR bytes.
+
+Meaningful host checks
+New model42 assertions PASS (including explicit reverse0, oppositebaseline refusal,
+controller disagreement). Actual production TrialDispatchGate6 timingchecks PASS:
+late baseline afterstop, metadata delay crossingdeadline even before queuedwatchdog,
+duplicate dispatch/start refusal. These tests execute real pure guard/model code,
+NOT Android Handler/IPC. Initial revised test compile omission preserved attempt1.
+Actual Android compile pending; no fake framework stub compilation claimed.
+
+Normal target qualification next (parent may run host-only in parallel with review)
+Bind ONLY this worktree onto /workspace/source/packages/services/Telephony in existing
+private builder; no active source replacement. Targets honor-sep-contract-draft TeleService.
+Depends hostaidl plus platform framework/telephony-common and existing TeleService deps.
+No separate global install/download/fullsystem build. Existing rootless32GiB8CPU recipe.
+Generated AIDL rule/source version and Java platform APIs must be normalSoong validated.
+Before actual image: independent source race/owner review; normal Android targetbuild;
+final-image contract/callsite/manifest/process/Enforcing gates; LPA feature/transport
+integration. Parent reports OpenEUICC7353fcb compiles; provisioning remains unvalidated.
+
+Lifecycle revision: Activity create/refresh reattaches existing prepared singleton via
+side-effect-free getter, no registration/retry; preparation/unavailable state visible.
+Owner retains max2phase serial-to-adapter routing so previous-phase late errors are
+logged by correct adapter after explicit physical return begins. Actual status logs
+only slot/generation/query/ATR classification/present/controller agreement.
+ACK policy audit is OPEN and delegated: no hardware readiness claim until vendor
+ACK_EXP handling for all relevant/ignored callbacks is implemented/reviewed.
+
+ACK audit resolved in this revision (ACK-POLICY-REVIEW.txt): all12 indication
+overrides pass shared ACK-first helper;type1 acknowledged even ignored/nullpayload.
+Matched finaltype2 acknowledged beforedelegate;type1 incomingACK does not consume
+serial or finishrequest;unknownserial noACK. Early0 consumes serial,trailing6 duplicate
+notackedagain. ACK uses same slot2IRadio.responseAcknowledgement one-waytx21, noUIAPI.
+Current host checks: model42 +absoluteguard6 +ACKpolicy11, plus52method statichelper
+coverage (not Android IPC tests). Original dormant-model flag/method removed only from
+actualintegration copy, preserving originalfrozenhistoricalmodel.
+
+Late incoming ACK1 after final0/2 now stays ignored (no final/error delivery),
+including known historical phase serial. Production AckTracker tests15 PASS.
+Normalbuild attempt1 fixed glob locationlabel;attempt2 fixed AIDL exact importroot
+normalization. Both failures/logs retained; no hardware operation.
