+qualifier tests49 model PASS (7identitycases), plusACK15 anddispatchguard6.
+Normalcompile3 PASS preserved with APK before surgicalidentitypatch;compile4required.
+
+Endpoint/readiness integration (HOST-ONLY, NOT enabled):
+The single EXCLUSIVE_COMPLETION_OWNER_QUALIFIED=false gate remains before metadata,
+registration and any mux operation. No Settings/LPA/profile entry is supplied.
+Request admission clears endpoint eligibility synchronously BEFORE posting worker work.
+A small publication lock binds current ticket/adapter/generation/serial; obsolete callbacks
