+Binder loss and ACK failure clear eligibility when observed, before queued cleanup.
+Cleanup captures the retired token and cannot close a newer-token observer. UI observer
+errors cannot undo CLEAN/known mux state or separate physical-return availability.
+This is a conditional serialized snapshot, not an atomic hardware/profile-operation lease.
+New mux requests retire only UI eligibility; they do not cancel an already admitted native
+operation. Existing absolute deadline/one-shot/no-retry/journal outcome rules still apply.
+Read-only reconciliation after card retirement is NOT implemented: generic ICC/record
